WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.146 --> 00:00:00.864
- [Voiceover] These are the people

00:00:00.864 --> 00:00:02.901
on Facebook who need to shut up.

00:00:02.901 --> 00:00:04.585
The liberal hippie girl.

00:00:04.585 --> 00:00:05.871
- The police are an organization

00:00:05.871 --> 00:00:07.987
sanctioned to oppress
us by our government,

00:00:07.987 --> 00:00:09.381
and we're just supposed to take that?

00:00:09.381 --> 00:00:11.064
- [Voiceover] The ultra conservative guy.

00:00:11.064 --> 00:00:12.340
- Thing is, if you give them welfare,

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:14.163
you disincentivize them to work.

00:00:14.163 --> 00:00:15.797
- [Voiceover] And the guy who
thinks they're both wrong.

00:00:15.797 --> 00:00:16.900
- Okay, America was never supposed

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:18.071
to be a two-party system.

00:00:18.071 --> 00:00:20.056
That's why we need Ron Paul.

00:00:20.056 --> 00:00:22.111
- [Voiceover] Girls who post party pics.

00:00:22.111 --> 00:00:23.237
There's nothing wrong with it except

00:00:23.237 --> 00:00:25.734
for the fact it's the same
pictures every weekend.

00:00:25.734 --> 00:00:27.975
And then it gets really
weird when you see this guy,

00:00:27.975 --> 00:00:29.332
your friend from eighth grade.

00:00:29.332 --> 00:00:31.794
He's closer to his 30s,
yet he keeps partying

00:00:31.794 --> 00:00:34.485
with 19 year olds.

00:00:35.132 --> 00:00:37.662
Then there's this girl,

00:00:37.662 --> 00:00:39.372
the workout enthusiast.

00:00:39.372 --> 00:00:42.323
She just posts pictures
of her nice, fit body.

00:00:42.323 --> 00:00:44.448
We get it, you're hot.

00:00:44.448 --> 00:00:46.526
Parents who are obsessed with their kids.

00:00:46.526 --> 00:00:48.441
You post a bunch of
pictures, and it's annoying.

00:00:48.441 --> 00:00:50.702
What's more annoying
is people who complain

00:00:50.702 --> 00:00:52.923
about parents who are
obsessed with their kids.

00:00:52.923 --> 00:00:54.571
You are the worst.

00:00:54.571 --> 00:00:56.348
And then there's this guy.

00:00:56.348 --> 00:00:57.346
- I just wanted to let you all know

00:00:57.346 --> 00:00:58.727
that my grandma died.

00:00:58.727 --> 00:01:00.313
- [Voiceover] The pity seeker.

00:01:00.313 --> 00:01:02.048
- Also my dog died, and I'm not looking

00:01:02.048 --> 00:01:04.067
for your sympathy, I'm
more looking for a date,

00:01:04.067 --> 00:01:04.950
because I'm single.

00:01:04.950 --> 00:01:05.983
- [Voiceover] And know what's even worse

00:01:05.983 --> 00:01:07.346
than the pity seeker?

00:01:07.346 --> 00:01:08.147
- You see this car?

00:01:08.147 --> 00:01:10.872
- [Voiceover] The
(censorship beeps) show off!

00:01:10.872 --> 00:01:13.951
- New promotion, I know, I know, I know,

00:01:13.951 --> 00:01:15.972
it's pretty awesome.

00:01:15.972 --> 00:01:17.741
- I'm getting married! (laughs)

00:01:17.741 --> 00:01:19.615
- [Voiceover] Your ex-girlfriend.

00:01:19.615 --> 00:01:20.924
I should have given you that ring.

00:01:20.924 --> 00:01:23.331
The person who keeps promising
they're going to change.

00:01:23.331 --> 00:01:24.887
- I've learned my lesson guys.

00:01:24.887 --> 00:01:28.450
I swear to God, never ever partying again.

00:01:28.450 --> 00:01:31.051
- [Voiceover] He doesn't
mean it, not at all.

00:01:31.051 --> 00:01:32.270
The guy who thinks Facebook

00:01:32.270 --> 00:01:34.766
is his own standup comedy show.

00:01:34.766 --> 00:01:36.113
And if you don't think he's funny,

00:01:36.113 --> 00:01:37.493
he's going to hit you with this:

00:01:37.493 --> 00:01:39.630
- And I'm not really sure
that you would get it.

00:01:39.630 --> 00:01:41.092
It's a little meta and --

00:01:41.092 --> 00:01:42.565
- [Voiceover] You suck dude!

00:01:42.565 --> 00:01:43.751
- [Voiceover] And worst of them all --

00:01:43.751 --> 00:01:45.970
- You suck, oh my God...

00:01:45.970 --> 00:01:47.872
- [Voiceover] The guy who's
too cool for Facebook.

00:01:47.872 --> 00:01:49.405
He hates on everything about it,

00:01:49.405 --> 00:01:51.626
yet he's still on it.

00:01:51.626 --> 00:01:54.071
- You suck!

